   <SourceLine>Function MeshAESCTR(key As String, data As MemoryBlock, iv As MemoryBlock) As MemoryBlock</SourceLine>
   <SourceLine>// AES-CTR through Xojo's Crypto (Crypto++). Nil on failure</SourceLine>
